<description>&lt;p&gt;Rebel forces have continued lethal attacks, killing at least 15 civilians in Tonj East and another 15 elsewhere, while a cattle raid in Duk County left six dead, including a prominent wrestler. Dozens are feared missing after an assault on Miny Island in Jonglei, and a large-scale killing of nearly 200 people was reported in Ruweng, prompting a government condemnation and investigation. The national election has been postponed again, now set for February 2027, and a Sudanese official has accused Ethiopia and South Sudan of fueling regional instability. According to UCDP, there were 2 battle-related deaths in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNWF90OFBKN1ZBeEwwQkZYQVdsRm1PZkgwcEQxM19wQjhGRFJyX0tlSkF4OUxiME1IV2U2TWFOdkloLXhmVjhZZjVnMXp2QkQxVXpvTG1RSVBJTTdxaFRaQ1hTdlZna0R2ZlZKcENUcTEycXhYZy1ibi1ILU9Fay1rZENXYl9IT0tXVUM5Q25QckVpZjZBNkRKMFE2aEJpUGdNZFB0T0txU216VmpjeXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Free Malaysia Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxQNDd0b1JqTkhCT1daalMtbHpnY0lBODhqNUFRZjFwMHMxM2hSN3BNSkg1bVU0cFZjaU5CRllDMjVreTFZUzRlN19DLUVHOWFZZV9QVEllV1k4elNoNlJ6NFFQU1l5c0NBVGRtb2VMWWQtSjVBVVVOaTU0aXhibS1tb0h0WVc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ratopati&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTE9PYU9KWTVqa1prT0NJVnNOS3FaOVRjTkhFU2ZWbU40M0VEWkhCT2FHWmRSaFBMRm1IXy1HUlNkMV9xN2FlMjZjRVZaaUo0Q1NiOGduRmpMYXhQNHBfdXZRWG5aUkY?oc=5&quot;&gt;TRT Afrika&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE82azEwWlNoWnZoMkFTUzB1V2ZROFJZV3J6bDNxWHktRjFLMDYzR19DdHpJT3lsbVVJQzMxbEt4U3loX2FGaGNmc